---
const supportedGames = ["MH3G / MH3U", "MH4G（规划中）", "MHGU / MHXX（规划中）"];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="MHED 存档修改器与配装分享平台" />
    <title>MHED · 怪物猎人存档修改器</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: Inter, "Noto Sans SC", system-ui, sans-serif; color: #172033; background: #f4f7fb; }
      body { margin: 0; }
      main { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 24px; }
      .eyebrow { color: #2563eb; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; }
      h1 { margin: 12px 0 18px; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 4.8rem); line-height: 1.05; }
      .lead { max-width: 680px; color: #526078; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; }
      .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin: 32px 0 52px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .button { padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; background: #2563eb; color: white; }
      .button.secondary { color: #2563eb; background: #e8f0ff; }
      .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
      .card { border: 1px solid #dde5f1; border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; background: white; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgb(44 62 96 / 7%); }
      .card p { color: #65728a; margin-bottom: 0; }
      footer { margin-top: 64px; color: #768299; font-size: .9rem; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <div class="eyebrow">MHED PLATFORM</div>
      <h1>存档留在本地，<br />配装自由分享。</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        MHED 提供怪物猎人存档修改与在线配装分享。平台只交换标准化配装数据，
        不上传完整存档、角色信息或原始装备字节。
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="#downloads">下载修改器</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="#games">支持范围</a>
      </div>
      <section id="games" class="grid">
        {supportedGames.map((game) => <article class="card"><strong>{game}</strong><p>独立游戏数据与安全写入规则。</p></article>)}
      </section>
      <section id="downloads" class="card" style="margin-top: 16px">
        <strong>MH3G / MH3U Windows 测试版</strong>
        <p>下载前请备份完整存档目录。该版本已接入在线配装广场。</p>
        <p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/AlexQFMM2/mh3g-saveEdit/releases/download/v1.3.0-beta.1/MH3USaveEditorGUI-windows-portable.zip">下载 v1.3.0-beta.1</a></p>
      </section>
      <footer>MHED 与 Capcom 无关联。使用前请备份完整存档目录。</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
